        "imate for one of the data elements (e.g. your IMU doesn't produce an\n# orientation estimate),"
        " please set element 0 of the associated covariance matrix to -1\n# If you are interpreting thi"
        "s message, please check for a value of -1 in the first element of each\n# covariance matrix, a"
        "nd disregard the associated estimate.\n\nstd_msgs/Header header\n\ngeometry_msgs/Quaternion or"
